- camel/memories/agent_memories.py
  - Classes: ChatHistoryMemory, VectorDBMemory, LongtermAgentMemory
  - Note: Core memory implementations for agents, managing chat history and vector DB memory

- camel/toolkits/memory_toolkit.py
  - Class: MemoryToolkit
  - Note: Toolkit exposing memory management methods (save, load, clear) as function tools for ChatAgent

### Tests
- test/toolkits/test_memory_toolkit.py
